-Wow! As always...

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:53.359 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
As always, amazing.

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:56.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Roy Wood Jr.!
[ Cheering ]

